<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Centrica upgraded at BZW.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Centrica upgraded at BZW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centrica Plc, the natural gas distributor spun off from British Gas, was raised to a &quot;hold&quot; from a &quot;sell&quot; at BZW, market sources said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>BZW also upped its &quot;fair value&quot; estimate for Centrica shares to 60p from 50p, reflecting higher-than-expected gas prices and a higher valuation of the company's Mordambe gas field, sources said.</p>
<p>Analysts at BZW were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The stock was down 1/4 at 58-1/2.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
